<title>UK: LB Rheinland-Pfalz sets $90 million bond.</title>
<headline>LB Rheinland-Pfalz sets $90 million bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers New Japan Securities Europe Ltd and IBJ International Plc.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDESBANK RHEINLAND-PFALZ-GIRONZENTRALE</p>
<p> AMT    $90 MLN	 COUPON     5.87 PCT  MATURITY    22.NOV.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE   L21.NOV.96</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    UNLISTED  PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> FORCE MAJ  YES	 MGT/UND    0.20 PCT  SELL CONC   1.00 PCT</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME, L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
